y_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fusQg9Pj0xUC8CzbO2IHrA","review_id":"-gwzYE_1Ht_wSbsX5166TQ","date":"2018-05-16T18:51:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9257165789604187,"text_excerpt":"I really enjoyed having my coffee at CC's. Yes, it does have a generic starbux type layout, but the drinks are their own coffee (not starbux which is a plus for me) and the flavor is good. Here's how to maximize your CC's experience: It's sultry humid hot in the French Quarter, every bit of shade in Jackson Square is taken, you're sticky but you're not hungry so you don't want to go $plash out into a nearby restaurant for shade and a place to sit, the musical entertainment of the day in the square's top feature is blaring loudness, not musical quality, your head is throbbing because you went on a bender on Bourbon Street last night and if anyone so much as mentions alcohol, you're going t..."},{"business_id":"fusQg9Pj0xUC8CzbO2IHrA","review_id":"10m27bNEJ11WOj4hZ8508g","date":"2015-12-14T19:02:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9255987405776978,"text_excerpt":"I stop here often on my way to work. I drink espresso, straight up, so I can't comment on their fancy dranks. the service is always fast and efficient, which is what I really want. they've got a variety of baked goods and breakfast sandwiches/bagels. I try not to but sometimes I can't help it and I get a blueberry muffin or a lemon bar. yum. the ambiance leaves a little to be desired, but I don't post up in coffee shops so that's not an issue for me. cc's or petite Amelie are my go to espresso spots on Royal."},{"business_id":"fusQg9Pj0xUC8CzbO2IHrA","review_id":"zlwD6Pwh7vb0YG5rQ7amIw","date":"2011-01-10T20:48:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9253540635108948,"text_excerpt":"I spent two days in here doing work. The staff were really friendly and outgoing, which is not a given for a coffee shop. Over the course of the two days, I got two cafe au laits and a cup of green tea. The cafe au laits were good, and the tea hit the spot (I needed to soothe my throat after enjoying the city). In fact the guy was really knowledgeable about the tea and was able to describe its taste and history very well. Bonus points for the tea being looseleaf and the employee being able to tell me the proper steeping time. I also had a slice of the pecan praline King Cake, which was pretty good. I'm sure there are better places to get King Cake in New Orleans, but this complemented my ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fusQg9Pj0xUC8CzbO2IHrA","photo_id":"Nj-Pw6REMwv4SH_ii9lUZg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Nj-Pw6REMwv4SH_ii9lUZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9046993255615234},{"business_id":"fusQg9Pj0xUC8CzbO2IHrA","photo_id":"HEqENQmYVQxe45n-xH3Gzw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HEqENQmYVQxe45n-xH3Gzw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9008426070213318},{"business_id":"fusQg9Pj0xUC8CzbO2IHrA","photo_id":"gehccyZZIFtUKdMQCJ4DUQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gehccyZZIFtUKdMQCJ4DUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.894244909286499},{"business_id":"fusQg9Pj0xUC8CzbO2IHrA","photo_id":"XphURYzlZV9jvWFfncIOvw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/XphURYzlZV9jvWFfncIOvw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8541346788406372},{"business_id":"fusQg9Pj0xUC8CzbO2IHrA","photo_id":"-VgXu_tU8RYfGQMHu6csqA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/-VgXu_tU8RYfGQMHu6csqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8261502981185913}]},"notebook_case":null}
